  "description": "* (Disclaimer: The content in this video is intended for educational and informational purposes only)\nBaltimore, Maryland — On December 16, 2025, at approximately 7:57 p.m., Eastern District Detectives were monitoring CCTV cameras when they observed suspected narcotics activity in the area of North Charles Street and East 21st Street. Members of the Eastern District Action Team (DAT) were directed to the area to further investigate and attempted to initiate a traffic stop on a vehicle believed to be involved in the activity. The vehicle fled from officers, and a pursuit ensued. A request was made for Foxtrot (BPD’s helicopter); however, it was not in service at the time. The vehicle entered the 500 block of West Lanvale Street and drove into a dead-end alley. Three officers exited their vehicle and approached on foot, issuing verbal commands for the occupants to show their hands. The vehicle suddenly reversed toward one officer and crashed into a fence. It then accelerated again towards the officer, at which point all three officers discharged their firearms. The passenger, 61-year-old Andrew Brown, fell out of the vehicle as it drifted in reverse. The driver, 37-year-old Devin Thomas, exited the vehicle and laid on the ground. Officers placed both males in handcuffs and rendered aid to Thomas, who had been struck by gunfire, until medics arrived on scene. Thomas was transported to an area hospital and has since been released. He was later arrested and charged with assault and dangerous weapon with intent to injure. A subsequent search of the vehicle yielded the recovery of two firearms and narcotics.\n\n🚨𝑇ℎ𝑖𝑠 𝑐ℎ𝑎𝑛𝑛𝑒𝑙 𝑝𝑟𝑜𝑣𝑖𝑑𝑒𝑠 𝑐𝑜𝑛𝑡𝑒𝑥𝑡𝑢𝑎𝑙 𝑑𝑜𝑐𝑢𝑚𝑒𝑛𝑡𝑎𝑡𝑖𝑜𝑛 𝑎𝑛𝑑 𝑎𝑛𝑎𝑙𝑦𝑠𝑖𝑠 𝑜𝑓 𝑟𝑒𝑎𝑙 𝑝𝑜𝑙𝑖𝑐𝑒 𝑖𝑛𝑐𝑖𝑑𝑒𝑛𝑡𝑠 𝑢𝑠𝑖𝑛𝑔 𝑝𝑢𝑏𝑙𝑖𝑐𝑙𝑦 𝑎𝑣𝑎𝑖𝑙𝑎𝑏𝑙𝑒 𝑟𝑒𝑐𝑜𝑟𝑑𝑠.\n\n⚠️𝑉𝑖𝑒𝑤𝑒𝑟 𝑑𝑖𝑠𝑐𝑟𝑒𝑡𝑖𝑜𝑛 𝑖𝑠 𝑎𝑑𝑣𝑖𝑠𝑒𝑑 𝑑𝑢𝑒 𝑡𝑜 𝑡ℎ𝑒 𝑠𝑒𝑟𝑖𝑜𝑢𝑠 𝑛𝑎𝑡𝑢𝑟𝑒 𝑜𝑓 𝑡ℎ𝑒 𝑐𝑜𝑛𝑡𝑒𝑛𝑡.⚠️\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\nSpecial thanks to Shout-Out Supporters on Patreon:\n- 'DIY Solar Power with Will Prowse'\n- Mark Frisch\n- LJ\n- Chase\n- Tavia Shields\n- Ga